    <string name="us_privacy_preset">Apply US privacy profile</string>
    <string name="field_privacy_us_only">US-only privacy policy</string>
    <string name="us_privacy_note">US privacy blocks device location and uses US region settings inside Claude. Internet access requires the probe to report a US exit and match the IP allowlist. This does not set up a VPN; an empty allowlist stays offline. Disable US-only policy before changing its required protections.</string>
